      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIP TOE FLOW (1) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a four-run winning streak, but could only manage fourth (19.90) at this track. The form out of last race has been strong. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CASHED UP BETH (2) was rewarded for her honesty after two minors on end with a deserved win last time, scoring at Q Lakeside over 457m (25.54). Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from seven starts. Can make it back-to-back wins. OUTPLAYED (3) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, two back missing the frame but last time hitting the line hard to place when second (28.08) in a Grade 4/5 at Casino last time. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Bold showing expected. BIG BOY ZULU (7) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
